  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic Engagement and Policy Dialogue</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support efforts to increase awareness and voter turnout, particularly of marginalised groups (youth, women, people with disabilities), and to ensure conflict resolution mechanisms are functional and ready to deal with and provide redress to grievances from stakeholders. This work will include:
a) Awareness raising activities: across the country, support efforts to ensure citizens, particularly vulnerable and marginalised groups (youth, women, people with disabilities), understand the importance of elections, how to register and vote &#x2013; and that authorities reach out to these groups and create conditions for their meaningful participation; b.) Strengthening dispute resolution mechanisms: across the country, ensure that judicial authorities are trained and prepared on how to adjudicate electoral disputes; and that law enforcement (the police) is aware of citizens&#x2019; rights and duties as part of elections.</narrative>
  </description>
